    "text": "If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to",
